* Fig 8.3 envelope (diode) AM detector. 1 MHz carrier, 1 kHz tone, m=0.5, 1N4148, Rl=10k, C=10 nF (tau=100 us).
.model D1N4148 D(Is=2.5n Rs=0.6 N=1.7 Cjo=4p Bv=100)
Vam in 0 SIN(0 0 1Meg) 
Bam am 0 V = 1*(1+0.5*sin(2*3.14159*1k*time))*sin(2*3.14159*1Meg*time)
Rs am a 50
D1 a o D1N4148
Cl o 0 10n
Rl o 0 10k
Cc o aud 10u
Rla aud 0 100k
.tran 20n 4m 0 20n
.control
run
meas tran apk max v(aud) from=2m to=4m
meas tran amin min v(aud) from=2m to=4m
let app = apk-amin
echo "recovered audio p-p = $&app V (envelope depth 0.5 x 1 V carrier -> ~1 V p-p less diode drop)"
.endc
.end
